OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in park pond
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe body of a woman was found in a pond
OL,6,Fat a park.
OL,8,FLancashire Police said the discovery
OL,9,Fwas made after officers were called to
OL,10,FLowther Gardens on Lowther Terrace,
OL,11,FLytham, at 09:00 BST.
OL,13,FThe force initially said the death was
OL,14,Fbeing treated as "unexplained".
OL,16,FIn an update later on Monday, it said
OL,17,Fit was not being treated as suspicious
OL,18,Fand a file would be prepared for the
OL,19,Fcoroner.
